  "description": "This spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally located in  Cloghan Village, just 30 minutes' drive from Tullamore and Athlone and a short drive from Banagher and Birr. The property features a bright kitchen/dining area, a comfortable living room, two double bedrooms, one single bedroom, and three bathrooms, including an ensuite. Outside, there is off-street parking and a private enclosed rear garden. This is an excellent opportunity to rent a well-maintained home in a convenient village setting. No pets permitted. \nReferences required. \nEnquiries by email or WhatsApp only; please do not phone. ",
